---
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2 id="audience-title">Tools that put SEOs in control</h2>
    <p>
      Technical SEO shouldn't be a black box or a pile of unnecessary features. Bare Bones makes essential settings easier to inspect, change, and keep consistent—so site owners, developers, and SEO practitioners can focus on decisions that matter.
    </p>
    <p>
      The bigger mission is to develop open standards for SEO settings that anyone can adopt. We focus on implementing and verifying technical controls, not prescribing keyword or content strategy. Explore <a href="/philosophy/">our philosophy</a> or inspect the open-source <a href={site.staticGithub}>AI/static-site standards</a> and <a href={site.github}>WordPress plugin</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: var(--measure); margin-inline: auto; margin-left: max(1.25rem, calc((100% - var(--wide)) / 2)); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem); }
  p { margin-top: var(--space-2); color: var(--ink-soft); }
  h2 + p { margin-top: var(--space-3); }
</style>
